{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787188215553075001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"grayish-candid-pittabird","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ccfe6841158f306bb60f739cedbef762e5032247c0389bc656cfcac1a3f0ef7a","event_uuid":"a0f39118-887a-4795-b9ef-e21d200588e1","position":{"commit_sha":"00bcfcea5b934b72c5c534d782eb6585809e13ab","position":"1787185925190577001-a0f39118-887a-4795-b9ef-e21d200588e1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fef8f9ce159baaf0fdd6c6af2433350e66df58d403ca05400505bd954bcef99c","event_uuid":"8b25779f-f0be-4b84-96f2-119d5680f5a6","position":{"commit_sha":"cc513368270d5f6cfb1bb11f469718109352c927","position":"1787186096417955001-8b25779f-f0be-4b84-96f2-119d5680f5a6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787185925190577001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## What\n\nWiden `_OPERATOR_ATTESTED_TAG_RE` (`src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_operator_attested.py:45`) to\n`\\[(?:non-codebase|operator-attested)\\]`, and widen the `.rebar/criteria_routing.json:75`\nactivation trigger `text_all` to match either spelling.\n\n## Why this is the keystone\n\nAll four deterministic consumers share the IDENTICAL compiled regex object — `decide_ops`,\n`workflow_ops`, `det_attestation_launder`, `det_measurement_provenance` each satisfy `is`\nagainst it. One pattern change propagates to every consumer with no new branch anywhere, which\nis why `det_floor.py` (793/800 LOC cap) and `decide_ops.plan_review_decide` (complexity 21,\ngrandfathered) need no edits and their gates do not fire.\n\n## Trap\n\nThe alternation MUST be non-capturing. `decide_ops.operator_attested_ac_texts` uses `findall()`,\nwhich returns TUPLES if the group captures, silently breaking Pass-3 enrichment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `_OPERATOR_ATTESTED_TAG_RE` matches `- [ ] [non-codebase] x` and `- [ ] [operator-attested] x`\n      case-insensitively, and does NOT match the `[operator_attested]` underscore near-miss.\n- [ ] `operator_attested_ac_texts` returns a `list[str]` (not tuples) for a description mixing\n      both spellings, proved by a test asserting element types.\n- [ ] The `.rebar/criteria_routing.json` `project.measurement-provenance` trigger fires on a\n      plan tagged `[non-codebase]` and on one tagged `[operator-attested]`, proved by a test.\n- [ ] All existing tests pass unchanged.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_operator_attested.py","reason":"widen the canonical tag regex to a non-capturing alternation"},{"path":".rebar/criteria_routing.json","reason":"widen the measurement-provenance activation trigger"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_det_floor_operator_attested.py","reason":"dual-match and findall-arity tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3726-a1b0-c9bb-4d83","ticket_type":"story","title":"S1 — widen the canonical tag matcher to accept [non-codebase] and [operator-attested]","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a0f39118-887a-4795-b9ef-e21d200588e1","8b25779f-f0be-4b84-96f2-119d5680f5a6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787188215553075001,"uuid":"bad1b8d9-c15c-407e-8d13-5d7739286df1"}